{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've probably been there - the holiday family dinner that slowly chips away at your sanity. That kind of awful-but-nostalgic experience, you know?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a masochistic trip down memory lane and relive all the awkward moments and infuriating relatives in <i>Family Dinner</i>. In this narrative-driven experience, you'll actually get to resolve those unresolved family dramas at the dinner table.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don't take too long! Complete all your missions and escape before your social battery runs out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game includes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your hot-and-cold disaster of a college sister</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Big bro, aka Mama's boy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An inappropriate uncle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mother's theatrics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some cake</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A few cats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026and more</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Estimated playtime: ~20 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Deck Compatibility:</strong> Family Dinner is playable on the Steam Deck. To play, you'll need to remap the &quot;Enter&quot; key to a controller button through Steam's controller configuration. We're working on native controller support in a future update, but the game is fully functional with this simple setup.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Survived Dinner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4066160/3ecf5dd5107703cc8a5389086421a5a9fa9d3f4d.jpg"},{"name":"Mission 1: Gravy Murder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4066160/431eabee750fc4ae5de19a652f924ff53c6a561c.jpg"},{"name":"Mission 2: Locked Up in the Bathroom","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4066160/f79e866a194597c6cb2dfe5ef8bc4aff2e9dd7f8.jpg"},{"name":"Mission 3: Gift Giving","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4066160/8d50bdc06df03b481d0e14bdb2c71b77455fc0c6.jpg"},{"name":"Speed Runner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4066160/4450332a75dde9afe4407c02d2a18fefa65858cc.jpg"},{"name":"Flash Dinner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4066160/c8865aa662c5db9249e415755f2db4fb19b66721.jpg"},{"name":"Barely Holding On","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4066160/b768102903fa5b0ad1fd6f66a8b86e577f6022cc.jpg"}],"total":7},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4066160?t=1765250692","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066160/164dc3ee6399da1615b336ce20ab0b2b4d6fed89/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765250692","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066160/33ae9e2767412ec8545c8f3bc9aeb3e5d8b249c2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765250692","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066160/33ae9e2767412ec8545c8f3bc9aeb3e5d8b249c2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765250692","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've probably been there - the holiday family dinner that slowly chips away at your sanity. That kind of awful-but-nostalgic experience, you know?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a masochistic trip down memory lane and relive all the awkward moments and infuriating relatives in <i>Family Dinner</i>. In this narrative-driven experience, you'll actually get to resolve those unresolved family dramas at the dinner table.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don't take too long! Complete all your missions and escape before your social battery runs out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game includes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your hot-and-cold disaster of a college sister</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Big bro, aka Mama's boy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An inappropriate uncle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mother's theatrics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some cake</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A few cats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026and more</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Estimated playtime: ~20 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Deck Compatibility:</strong> Family Dinner is playable on the Steam Deck. To play, you'll need to remap the &quot;Enter&quot; key to a controller button through Steam's controller configuration. We're working on native controller support in a future update, but the game is fully functional with this simple setup.</p>","developers":["Marcela Stolzmann","Mari Fujiwara"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066160/3fe68d7f977e44bf251f63a70a15e00487d88f9a/header.jpg?t=1765250692","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 16.04+ / Debian 9+ / Fedora 28+ / CentOS 7+ (or equivalent distributions)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Any x86-64 dual-core processor from 2010+<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrat